        <source>Death to Protectorate!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">За Свободу.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>For Freedom.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">СРО – наше. ::Піднімає кулак у повітрі.::</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>SRO is ours. ::Raises fist in the air.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Жодних Банк не видно… поки що.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>No Cans in sight... for now.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми змусимо покидьків заплатити за вбивство Шреда!</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We'll make the bastards pay for killing Shred!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Він помер за Вільних Дронів – Кокошка, справжній воїн!</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>He died for the Free Drones - Kokoschka, a true warrior!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Перемога так солодко смакує.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Victory sure feels good.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Дякую за звільнення наших хлопців, $(#man/sister).</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Thanks for freeing our boys, $(#man/sister).&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми як слід розтрощили тих Банк, правда?</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We sure smashed those Cans, right?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Анархія!</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Anarchy!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Одного дня Форт Апогей згорить!</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>One day, Fort Apogee will burn!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Що ти хочеш зробити?::</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
